            "line": 795,
            "text": "def MonoidHom.comp [MulOne M] [MulOne N] [MulOne P] (hnp : N →* P) (hmn : M →* N) :\n    M →* P where\n  toFun x := hnp (hmn x)\n  map_one' := by simp\n  map_mul' := by simp"
